{"id":"bislang","lemma":"bislang","pos":"adv","rank":4776,"glosses":["so far, hitherto, until now"],"ipa":"/bɪsˈlaŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/85/De-bislang.ogg/De-bislang.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Bislang ist nichts passiert.","en":"So far nothing has happened.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Was ist bislang geschehen?","en":"What's happened so far?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to occur"}]},{"text":"Bislang habe ich es niemandem gesagt.","en":"So far, I've told no one.","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"nobody, no one","l":"niemand"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]},{"text":"Dein Aufsatz ist bislang der beste.","en":"Your composition is the best yet.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"essay"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"}]},{"text":"Ich habe bislang darüber eigentlich nicht nachgedacht.","en":"I hadn't really considered that until now.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"above"},{"g":"really"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to think","l":"nachdenken"}]}]}